WEBVTT

00:00:00.351 --> 00:00:02.491
Of course, not everything starts with a bigger

00:00:02.491 --> 00:00:02.751
goal.

00:00:04.031 --> 00:00:06.191
Sometimes, something just needs your attention today.

00:00:07.391 --> 00:00:09.691
Suppose the pharmacy hasn't filled a medication you

00:00:09.691 --> 00:00:09.831
need.

00:00:10.571 --> 00:00:12.051
You can add a task to today.

00:00:12.711 --> 00:00:14.511
Call the pharmacy about my missing medication.

00:00:16.051 --> 00:00:18.791
You or Symphony’s AI can prepare the details

00:00:18.791 --> 00:00:22.711
beforehand: the correct store’s verified phone number, which

00:00:22.711 --> 00:00:25.471
medication is missing, and any notes from your

00:00:25.471 --> 00:00:26.311
last conversation.

00:00:27.151 --> 00:00:29.831
When you’re ready, open the task and tap

00:00:29.831 --> 00:00:30.631
the number to call.

00:00:31.451 --> 00:00:32.611
The details are right there.

00:00:33.491 --> 00:00:37.411
Afterward, record the answer and add any follow-up.
